  "subTitleDesc": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CM03119",
    "sub_id": "73534",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "sub_title": "1.人地關係與環境倫理。\n2.環境生態調查與分析。\n3.環境永續個案研討。\n4.環境永續發展前景。",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "1.人地關係與環境倫理\n(1)環境生態概論\n(2)地理與風水\n(3)環境生態研究經典\n2.環境生態調查與分析\n(1)穿越線生態調查法理論\n(2)室內/戶外實作練習\n(3)生態調查結果發表與檢討分析\n3.環境永續個案研討\n(1)都市個案\n(2)生態個案\n(3)產業發展個案\n(4)環境問題研討\n4.環境永續發展前景\n(1)環境永續未來展望\n(2)人地關係省思",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "環境永續概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY",
    "describe_ch": "以環境生態學的基礎，深入淺出地介紹環境生態與永續性的關鍵概念，再透過穿越線調查法，觀察、紀錄與分析環境生態特徵，提升學生思索環境永續性的意義。並結合聯合國的永續發展目標(SDGs)，利用幾個個案的評估來練習深度思考。\n本課程前半段有實作練習，讓學生在室內環境生態與野外的生態調查過程中，認識生態的永續性；而後半段介紹的個案，則以具代表性為主，包括都市、旅遊、生態保育的永續性探討，以及因應2050淨零碳排議題的調適之道。期盼在課程結束之後，能夠認識環境生態、了解環境永續的重要性，可為接下來的土地資源利用等課程奠定基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "After introducing the key concepts of environmental ecology and sustainability, the transect-line method is used to observe, note and analyze environmental characteristics to enhance students consider the meaning of environmental sustainability. Also, combined with the United Nations' Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), evaluating some cases to practice in-depth thinking.\nThere are practical exercises in the first half of this course to allow students to understand the sustainability of ecology during the process of indoor environmental ecology and outdoor ecological investigation; while the cases introduced in the second half are mainly representative, including discussions on the sustainability of cities, tourism, and ecological conservation, as well as adaptation ways to face with the Net-Zero Action by 2050. It is hoped that after the completion of this course, students will be able to understand environmental ecology and the importance of environmental sustainability, which will lay the foundation for subsequent courses related to land resource utilization.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解環境生態基本知識，以及生態圈的組成、運作與地球上各種不同生態系的特徵。",
      "describe_en": "To understand the knowledge of environmental ecology and the major elements, operation of different ecosystems on earth and their features."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解自然資源使用與保育之間的關係，與自然生態觀察與探索之道。",
      "describe_en": "To understand the relations between uses and conservation of natural resources, and the way to observe and inquiry the natural ecosystem."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "介紹都市生態系的結構，並思考生態永續在其中扮演的關鍵角色，以及面對2050年淨零排放，政府與居民將如何調適。",
      "describe_en": "To introduce the structure of an urban ecosystem, and to think the key role of Environmental Sustainability in it. And also, in response to the Net-Zero Action by 2050, how will the government and residents adapt."
    }
  ],
